<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 107,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 107,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's actual receipts 107,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early barrows and gilts traded $0.50 lower than the mid-session Monday. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    49.00 -50.00	   50.00 -51.00</p>
<p>few			48.50 -50.50	   49.50 -51.50</p>
<p>few  one interest	     48.00		    49.00</p>
<p>Sows - generally steady. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  40.00 -43.00	   41.50 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   43.00 -46.00	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    46.00 -51.00	   47.00 -52.00</p>
